+@DESC@
+FcPatternAddWeak is essentially the same as FcPatternAdd except that any
+values added to the list have binding <parameter>weak</parameter> instead of <parameter>strong</parameter>.
+@@
+
+@TITLE@		FcPatternAdd-Type
