+stdout. The format should not be considered part of the library
+specification as it may change in the future.
+@@
+
+@RET@		FcBool
+@FUNC@		FcValueEqual
+@TYPE1@		FcValue%		@ARG1@		v_a
+@TYPE2@		FcValue%		@ARG2@		v_b
